    "title": "How Did Hilary Swank Hide Her Pregnancy? Actress Reveals How She Kept Her Big News a Secret for Months - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By AJ Pitts ,\n1 days ago Getty Hilary Swank is dishing on her pregnancy!\nThe 52-year-old actress recently announced that she is pregnant and expecting her third child with husband Philip Schneider , by sharing a cute video on Instagram.\nIn the caption, she revealed that she is due in December, which is less than two months away!\nSo, how did she keep the news a secret for so long?\nHilary Swank reveals how she hid her pregnancy In a new interview on the Question Everything podcast , Hilary credited those in her small town for not leaking her pregnancy.\n“I live in a very small town. It’s a town I grew up in, and everyone there has been so just respectful of my privacy, and it hasn’t leaked,” Hilary shared. “Clearly, I don’t stay at home all the time. I was working up until about 17 weeks pregnant, so no one really knew on set either.”\n“I’m a pretty private person, and there was no reason to really, I don’t know, say anything,” she continued. “And then we passed this wonderful diaper bill, and I wanted to show up here, and so I was like, ‘Well, hello everybody and meet the baby in my belly.’”\nDuring an appearance on The Drew Barrymore Show after revealing her pregnancy, Hilary reacted to backlash to women having babies in their 40s and 50s.\nShe also recently revealed what her pregnancy cravings have been like with her second pregnancy. (If you didn’t know, she gave birth to twins in 2023.)\nHilary Swank will be back on TV screens soon when the fourth and final season of Yellowjackets premieres in November. Check out the teaser trailer!",
    "summary": "The 52-year-old actress recently announced that she is pregnant and expecting her third child with husband Philip Schneider , by sharing a cute video on Instagram. It’s a town I grew up in, and everyone there has been so just respectful of my privacy, and it hasn’t leaked,” Hilary shared. “And then we passed this wonderful diaper bill, and I wanted to show up here, and so I was like, ‘Well, hello everybody and meet the baby in my belly.’”",
